{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2f0da6f728b781248628118eefbf8d846bea382085677760049977f3e8a3f977","ja":"今日のお仕事はこれで最後ですね！\nいっぱい笑ったな～♪　楽しかったな～♪","zh":"今天的工作这就是最后一个了呢！\n笑了好多次呢～♪ 真开心呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
