{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cec892830afca5c9b3ad2d52f81a7b619dfc6b61038df5d1a7348e6c73fa5738","ja":"あれっ！？　なんか友達からいっぱいメッセージが\n届いてる？　どうしたんだろう？","zh":"哎呀！？怎么朋友发了好多消息过来？\n发生什么事了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"72c9f4ff4ee3bc530861030d32365e387266a5ab8a8ce200476998e52a564966","ja":"さっきのインタビューの感想じゃない？\n生放送見てくれてたんだよ、きっと。","zh":"应该是在说刚才采访的感想吧？\n肯定是有收看直播啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d92a09ff7c771059e896405c07a7c5094e4a8a33efa9d16af5d1257f5d64318f","ja":"あ、そうかも。\n楽しんでもらえたかな……。","zh":"啊，可能确实是那样。\n大家玩得开心吗……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8de7e7828dd9e752238450e84d24c3574ff5ac5f8964779fec9d81e3126dd2b6","ja":"って、ええぇぇーっ！？","zh":"不对，诶诶诶——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3d087307a99f67ef5c6cd921f661ac246e96dd54b41d90f6fb670caf8e1ee1d3","ja":"ど、どうしたんですか！？","zh":"怎、怎么了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"98749f61fd2ca52c72b534ad7c74db7444cece0e530648fa00cab0cf0b4b5daf","ja":"……さっきの番組に映ったプロムの写真が、\nSNSですごくバズってるって！","zh":"……刚才节目里播出的毕业舞会照片，\n在社交平台上大火特火呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"de233a2471b102d9c9db29003f9fb8b36171ce9a2648b37df83f0f850440c4fe","ja":"ホントだ！　トレンドにも入ってるヨ～！","zh":"真的耶！还上了热门趋势哟～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"074050a35f819c2ae8e67c320315659f5013015eafee72bb885091b3c1ed7674","ja":"すごい……。\nみんなプロムの話題で持ちきりだね。","zh":"好厉害……\n大家都在热烈讨论毕业舞会的话题呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a28633abeeb9f0712eb64a219c538d72beea23a4860e3158f9081d5e55d466bb","ja":"「テーブルの料理がどれもおいしそう」\n「ドレスで着飾ってメイクまでしてるの本格的」","zh":"“桌上的菜看起来都好好吃”\n“盛装打扮还化了妆，真专业啊”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ce59ec5fdc29f35b1b8672a23e2af15d6511aab0b2b9912c0880cafba9bd1d32","ja":"他にもいろいろコメントがあるけど、\nどれも好意的みたいだよ。","zh":"虽然还有各种各样的评论，\n不过看起来全都很友善呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"7d1853727d9622cb15f513f9779dccd23042561a23d7d647f6ec6967c3cf6620","ja":"こっちには「自分たちもやってみたい」だって！","zh":"这边写着“我们也想试试看”呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"c4f1aad7082bdc4dea3c555fd15743fc1a97f3c6003d916cde92d3358a99d00e","ja":"美奈子ってば、すっかり時の人だね♪\nクロエみたい！","zh":"美奈子真是彻底成了当下的大红人呢♪\n就跟克洛伊一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"260f2d3e5bb4cc6b206161cfc3e31c0f996e44ced64e93d92b5dfa3f993ba55f","ja":"私は普通に友達とプロムを楽しんだだけで、\n特別なことは何もしてないんだけどなあ……。","zh":"我只是普通地和朋友一起享受了舞会而已，\n并没有做什么特别的事啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1456.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"50f8de499e8c0988040fcab11644dabfb3e6fa85d94e37189cb918e02475cd96","ja":"にゃはは。だから言ったでしょ♪\nバズるきっかけは『何気ないこと』だって。ねっ♪","zh":"喵哈哈。我就说吧♪\n爆火的契机就是“无心插柳”呢。对吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
